  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID-Gabon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to assist the Government of Gabon to conduct a policy analysis for the Bas-Ogoou Ramsar Site, to assess the current status and threats to the Bas-Ogoou ecosystem, and to develop standards for sustainable management of this and other Ramsar wetland sites in Gabon. ....Activities include: policy assessment of institutional and legal frameworks for managing Ramsar sites; threat analysis, land use assessment and vulnerability map; and a case study about the Bas-Ogoou and a model for standards and actionable process for the management of Ramsar sites in Gabon.</narrative>
  </description>
